#
# The image build context: sources only, never local build output, secrets
# or editor state. Keeping it small keeps builds fast and reproducible.

.git
**/target
**/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
web/playwright-report
web/test-results
dist
lcov.info
.env
.env.*
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
